<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<subsection xml:id='sec_intro' xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" >
  <title>Objective</title>
  <p>
The learner will practice problem solving and modeling skills, discuss
strategies and approaches, and begin to appreciate the importance of modeling
and functions in problem solving.
  </p>
  <p>
We will begin by considering the questions on our own, then move to small group
discussion and finally whole class discussion.
  </p>
</subsection>
